// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DefeatedManticoreDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskOwnerPage Text :
"P619105383" "<color yellow>Only the task owner can speak to Manticore.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page OpeningPageSouvenir Text :
"P3204028658" "{HeroName}, they took her! I couldn't stop them! None of us could! He kept bringing in more and more illusions to throw us off!"
// Answer Text :
"P2428544545" "Malaise, I remember. I delt with him some time ago with Calvin Scott."
// Page OpeningPageNoSouvenir Text :
"P2603135127" "{HeroName}, they took her! I couldn't stop them! None of us could! He kept bringing in more and more illusions to throw us off!<br><br>It was <color red>Malaise</color>, but he <i>has</i> to be working for someone else! He's never been able to pull something this big off before! I know that face from <i>anywhere</i>.<br><br>I knew Shalice and Liberty were wrong about him; once a  villain, <i>always</i> a villain."
// Page OpeningPageNoSouvenir SayOutLoudText :
"P3088163990" "It was Malaise, but he has to be working for someone else! I knew it, once a villain, always a villain."
// Answer Text :
"P3831316222" "That can wait. Let's get you to the hospital."
// Answer Text :
"P355455815" "Wait, who's Malaise? (optional)"
// Page KnowsMalaise Text :
"P3888777884" "Then you know how he was given a chance at redemption... and now just how far he's fallen from any chance at that now.<br><br><i>Ever.</i>"
// Page KnowsMalaise SayOutLoudText :
"P984754570" "Then you know how he was given a chance at redemption... and now just how far he's fallen from any chance at that now."
// Page WhoIsMalaise Text :
"P3119756427" "Some ex-con that the Vindicators gave a chance at redemption. A psychic. Wayward type. My wife took it upon herself to train him in the use of his powers and to keep him from straying back towards evil.<br><br>She swore that he was on the straight and narrow, but I knew differently. Sometimes, I do hate it when I'm right, {HeroName}."
// Page WhoIsMalaise SayOutLoudText :
"P758368291" "Malaise is some ex-con that the Vindicators gave a chance at redemption, psychic, crazy type."
// Answer Text :
"P1044182563" "Alright. Now let's get you to the hospital."
// Page EndPage Text :
"P2880630717" "Hnh. I can get my own way there. Let's hurry, we've got to get Alexis back.<br><br>I've sent orders to Agent Kwahu, we need to get this situation under control, <i>now</i>."
// Page EndPage SayOutLoudText :
"P237533049" "Hnh. I can get my own way there. Let's hurry, we've got to get Alexis back."
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P856364347" ""
// SendOffString :
"P3338830843" "Excellent. Here are some dossiers to give you some background on our persons of interest. Take a moment to read them over.  <color yellow>Marshal Blitz</color> has requested an arms summit to negotiate a permanent ceasefire between Warburg and Paragon City. At this juncture, we have no insight into his sudden change of heart or agenda, which makes me think it is a trap. However, if it isn't, then this could be one of the biggest breakthroughs of this decade.<br><Br> What is of special concern is that Blitz has demanded that he will only <i>speak</i> with <color yellow>Consulate Alexis Cole-Duncan</color>, daughter of Statesman and mother of Ms. Liberty.<br><br>I trust now that the political gravitas and its possible implications have set in. Marshal Blitz, madman of the Warburg, wants to meet with <color yellow>Statesman's daughter</color> on <i>enemy territory</i> to strike an unlikely truce. He claims that only she can negotiate a proper treaty and that anyone else will botch it up. <br><br><color yellow>Manticore</color> will accompany her; Statesman has been left out due to several risks of having him there. We are allowed super-powered help outside of the Freedom Phalanx, which is where you come in. We have transport ready for you to go to the conference in Warburg. It will be your job to provide back up, incase the conference goes awry. <color orange>Make sure you're prepared, as you'll be deep in the territory of Rogue Arachnos.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P518296660" "Guard the Warburg Arms Summit"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2113962659" "My team is still waiting for you at Warburg."
// TaskTitle :
"P3000448312" "<color deepskyblue>Bear Any Burden</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2788226736" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Sustainable Heroes</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2478198546" "This conference hall looks like it was hastily assembled for the arms summit."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1872668304" "Attend the Warburg Conference"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3515542916" "Keep on your guard during the discussions"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P4127324151" "Defeat Marshal Blitz!"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3371190097" "Fend off the Rogue Arachnos forces!"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P450514375" "Find Manticore"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3383608100" "Nothing"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4176496452" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Get her out of there now, Manticore! {HeroName}, hold position and take out Blitz and his forces!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3057253240" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Scrambled reports are coming in from the perimeter. Comms are unreliable, but it sounds like Rogue Arachnos forces are cutting off the established escape routes."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1608669343" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Say again, Perimeter Two? I couldn't understand your last update. What's wrong with our comms?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2612541585" "Arachnos Checkpoint Guard"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1015140988" "Alexis Cole-Duncan"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3771026350" "<t=5 d=5><t=10 d=5>Please, Blitz, let's keep this discussion calm.<t=10 d=5>You are the one who called for a complete ceasefire, Blitz.<t=11 d=5>Perhaps if you were willing to have our negotiations elsewhere, we could give you more ground.<t=5 d=5>This is getting us nowhere. Tell us again, Blitz, your motives behind this ceasefire agreement. Just once more."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1127431811" "Hello, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1088294622" "Manticore"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3657536376" "<t=45 d=5><t=4 d=5>Blitz! Don't do anything stupid, not with {HeroName} and I here!<t=5 d=5>This is why we brought back up. {HeroName} will take you down while we get out of here!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3085100989" "Marshal Blitz"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1306488733" "<t=10 d=5>Shall we begin? -Again-?<t=10 d=5>CALM?! YOUR - Ahem... your terms are still ridiculous.<t=10 d=5>I know, but YOU are not willing to give enough to continue that ceasefire!<t=3 d=5>Like Paragon City?! You forget your place, Alexis! You know I would never agree to that! <t=8 d=5>Or are you just trying to antagonize me?<t=3 d=5>I have a better idea.<t=3 d=5>Let's stop this.<t=3 d=5>By now, all of your escape routes have been secured. You're coming with US, Alexis!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2205865860" "So, you're {HeroName}? Let's see how tough you are!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3341332330" "Hrmph, you're good, but not good enough. Jean, we're leaving, call in the real ambushes!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2182538397" "Jean"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1825492583" "Well, it seems this all just became terribly interesting."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1514528738" "<t=1 d=1><t=3 d=4>As you wish."
// Script Variable ACTOR1_NAME :
"P2558379567" "Reporter"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3177773160" "Hello there."
// Script Variable ACTOR1_NAME :
"P1244673160" "Rogue Crab Spider Slicer"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_NAME :
"P1582218572" "Rogue Mu Striker"
// Script Variable ACTOR3_NAME :
"P4038853561" "Rogue Fortunata"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2703864863" "<shout>You heard the orders, take them down!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3826712686" "<shout>Corner them!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2139614890" "<shout>You're too late, we have the woman!"

