"P2626736891" "<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>The WEB Technician should be close, {HeroName}. My team's reporting in that she's been captured by hostiles."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4086919256" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>I'm marking the location of the launch controls for you now, {HeroName}. Ensure the WEB Technician gets there safely."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1185449412" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Nice work, {HeroName}. Disarming a chemical nuke isn't exactly easy under duress, so stay close to her."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P335528138" "<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You've got incoming, {HeroName}."
