"P1872362066" "These tunnels reek of Arachnoids. Blitz and his forces clearly have given up on trying to maintain the Arachnoids in this part of Warburg."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1288010827" "Go through the tunnels to get to the surface"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P783453547" "Defeat Marshal Blitz"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3424411474" "Go inside the main building to find Alexis Cole-Duncan"

