// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3842828714" "'Jean'"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1551474305" "The story would never have moved forward without her death!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3509708467" "We're just beginning, my friends!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2926479044" "<t=5 d=5><t=10 d=5>Come now, Manticore, you're saying you do not enjoy my grand play?<t=10 d=5>You could never hope to comprehend the true mind of an artist, Manticore.<t=10 d=5>Blitz was but a side character. I, however, would be one of the protagonists. Shall I reveal the next act?<t=10 d=5>Now... behold, Manticore, the revelation of your lifetime!<t=10 d=5>Dead would be the word you're looking for."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3588700061" "<t=10 d=5>MALAISE! Put Alexis down, NOW! This insane scheme that you have is over!<t=10 d=5>You have brought us to the brink of annhiliation, Malaise! And for what?!<t=10 d=5>{HeroName} defeated Blitz, Malaise. It's over, stop the ritual!<t=10 d=5>Don't do anything stupid, Malaise! {HeroName} and I have you cornered!<t=10 d=5>What... Alexis?! She's...<t=10 d=5>You... you are going to PAY for this, Malaise!! {HeroName}! NOW!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"

